  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've sorted out the missing summer rolls, but I had to refund them to your card instead of adding account credit. Here's why.\n\n**What I did:** I refunded **$9.00**, the full price of the summer rolls, to your Visa ending in 4242. It should show up within 3\u20135 business days.\n\n**Why it's not credit:** Credit for a missing item is the item's price plus 20%, which would be $10.80. But you can receive at most $40.00 in account credit in one conversation as a Plus member. With the $30.00 in late-delivery credit from earlier, adding $10.80 would bring the total to $40.80. When credit would go over that limit, the item has to be refunded to your card.\n\nYou reported this just in time. Missing items have to be reported within 48 hours of delivery, and for this order that window closed at 7:45 PM tonight.\n\nTo recap today:\n- $30.00 in account credit for the late Saffron Lane and Pho Real deliveries\n- $9.00 refunded to your card for the missing summer rolls\n\nCan I help with anything else?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for sorting out the summer rolls. I'll accept the $9.00 refund to my Visa and keep an eye out for it in the next few days. I'll also check my notification settings, since I never got that Taqueria update. That covers everything I had in my note, so thanks for going through them with me."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Monique. Thanks for having your notes ready, it made checking each order much easier.\n\nYour $30.00 credit will be applied automatically to your next order. The $9.00 refund should reach your Visa within 3\u20135 business days.\n\nI'm sorry about all the late deliveries this week, and I hope your next orders arrive on time. Have a good evening!"
  }
